{"segment_id": "segment_00001", "start": 30.0, "end": 60.0, "speech": "一个能力。那这个地方呢，我问您答，尽量不要看着这个板书啊，板书只是起到一个提示的作用。您不妨看着文章，而且文章如果读的非常熟了，那我的问题应该也能听懂，问题不大。来了啊，Whose office did you enter? The hotel manager's office. Next one. Why did you feel upset? I have lost fifty pounds.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000008.webp", "time": 31.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Comprehension"], "scores": [0.98484, 0.99963], "boxes": [[[1496.0, 48.0], [1738.0, 48.0], [1738.0, 97.0], [1496.0, 97.0]], [[93.0, 138.0], [463.0, 136.0], [463.0, 195.0], [93.0, 198.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
