{"segment_id": "segment_00005", "start": 150.0, "end": 180.0, "speech": "Outside my room. Okay, very good. 下一题 asking questions，锻炼大家能听懂一般疑问句和啊，就能会说啊一般疑问句和特殊疑问句，对吧？也就是发我们发问的能力。 Okay，好，那第一个就是例子。 Ask me if I entered an hotel manager's office. Entered，提醒了你 did 提前，对吧？我们把它变一般疑问句，然后来一个 whose。那", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000014.webp", "time": 153.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Asking questions", "训练目标：", "会说一般疑问句＆特殊疑问句", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.97501, 0.99843, 0.97742, 0.97462, 0.99862, 0.99919], "boxes": [[[1497.0, 50.0], [1737.0, 50.0], [1737.0, 96.0], [1497.0, 96.0]], [[92.0, 136.0], [495.0, 140.0], [495.0, 201.0], [92.0, 196.0]], [[147.0, 283.0], [378.0, 283.0], [378.0, 340.0], [147.0, 340.0]], [[148.0, 345.0], [814.0, 345.0], [814.0, 408.0], [148.0, 408.0]], [[32.0, 594.0], [246.0, 604.0], [243.0, 655.0], [29.0, 645.0]], [[638.0, 590.0], [826.0, 602.0], [822.0, 657.0], [634.0, 645.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000015.webp", "time": 166.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Asking questions"], "scores": [0.9929, 0.98949], "boxes": [[[1496.0, 50.0], [1737.0, 48.0], [1737.0, 95.0], [1496.0, 97.0]], [[90.0, 133.0], [495.0, 137.0], [494.0, 204.0], [89.0, 199.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000016.webp", "time": 175.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Asking questions", "T: Ask me if l entered the hotel manager's ofice.", "S: Did you enter the hotel manager's office?"], "scores": [0.97659, 0.9943, 0.93382, 0.97571], "boxes": [[[1496.0, 48.0], [1737.0, 48.0], [1737.0, 98.0], [1496.0, 98.0]], [[91.0, 135.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 202.0], [91.0, 198.0]], [[139.0, 279.0], [1281.0, 281.0], [1281.0, 346.0], [139.0, 344.0]], [[144.0, 345.0], [1178.0, 345.0], [1178.0, 411.0], [144.0, 411.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "那 whose 肯定是对 hotel managers 提问，对吧？那所以肯定是 whose office did you enter？啊，你进的是谁的办公室？接下来呢，我们要做的事情就是给大家讲一下思路啊，各位下课去写出来，然后看着自己写的答案，保证是对的，然后大声朗读来了。第一个 who， who 可以直接对主语提问，不用变一般疑问句，答案就是 who entered the hotel", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000017.webp", "time": 191.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Asking questions", "1.l entered the hotel manager's office.", "(Whose) (Who) (Why)"], "scores": [0.97766, 0.99823, 0.97537, 0.95029], "boxes": [[[1496.0, 48.0], [1738.0, 48.0], [1738.0, 97.0], [1496.0, 97.0]], [[91.0, 134.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 203.0], [91.0, 198.0]], [[145.0, 279.0], [1036.0, 279.0], [1036.0, 341.0], [145.0, 341.0]], [[144.0, 335.0], [642.0, 342.0], [641.0, 408.0], [143.0, 402.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00007", "start": 210.0, "end": 240.0, "speech": "manager's office? Why? 那你就变一般疑问句，然后再对整句提问就可以了。OK，很简单。第二题，I sat down. Did 提前 What 点点 do？注意它基本就是标准答案，由时态决定，所以这地方叫 What did you do？OK，那 Who 呢？对主语提问，直接替代，不用变一般疑问句。Who sat down？ I'd just lost fifty pounds. OK，注意撇 D 有两个可能性，Would 和", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000018.webp", "time": 219.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Asking questions", "1.l entered the hotel manager's office.", "(Whose)(Who) (Why)", "2.I sat down.(What ...do)(Who)"], "scores": [0.94817, 0.99564, 0.94911, 0.97371, 0.95579], "boxes": [[[1495.0, 48.0], [1736.0, 48.0], [1736.0, 97.0], [1495.0, 97.0]], [[91.0, 135.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 202.0], [91.0, 198.0]], [[144.0, 280.0], [1036.0, 278.0], [1036.0, 340.0], [144.0, 343.0]], [[143.0, 336.0], [643.0, 342.0], [642.0, 408.0], [142.0, 403.0]], [[144.0, 422.0], [891.0, 425.0], [891.0, 484.0], [144.0, 481.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000019.webp", "time": 231.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Asking questions", "1.l entered the hotel manager's office.", "(Whose) (Who)(Why)", "2.I sat down.(What ...do)(Who)"], "scores": [0.95668, 0.99529, 0.95956, 0.97716, 0.93933], "boxes": [[[1495.0, 48.0], [1737.0, 48.0], [1737.0, 97.0], [1495.0, 97.0]], [[91.0, 135.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 202.0], [91.0, 198.0]], [[144.0, 280.0], [1036.0, 278.0], [1036.0, 340.0], [144.0, 343.0]], [[144.0, 336.0], [643.0, 342.0], [642.0, 408.0], [143.0, 403.0]], [[144.0, 422.0], [891.0, 425.0], [891.0, 484.0], [144.0, 481.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
